.TH lst2bin 1 "2026 November 14" ""

.SH NAME
lst2bin \- Convert list file to binary

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lst2bin
<input.lst> <output.bin>

.SH COPYRIGHT
CoreLAB is Copyright (C) 2026 by Pozsar Zsolt.

.SH DESCRIPTION
The lst2bin script converts a list file to a binary file. It utilizes awk to
extract the memory addresses and their corresponding hexadecimal opcodes from
the input file, and then pipes the extracted data to xxd to generate the raw
binary output.
.PP
The script is useable on Unix-like operating systems.

.SH FILES
.TP
.B *.lst:
Input list file.
.TP
.B *.asm:
Output binary file.

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal exit.
.TP
.B 1
Insufficient parameters.
.TP
.B 2
Missing dependency.

